tools.description:
Searches Wikipedia in any language and returns matching page titles with a one-line description and an excerpt.
Use when: you need to find the right Wikipedia page for a topic, person, place or concept.
Example: {"query":"Marie Curie","lang":"en"}

Short summary (lead paragraph) of one Wikipedia page, with its description, last edit time and link.
Use when: you need a quick, sourced overview of a topic.
Example: {"title":"Marie Curie","lang":"en"}

Full text of one Wikipedia article as plain text, in pages of up to 20,000 characters (use start to read further).
Use when: you need details beyond the summary.
Example: {"title":"Marie Curie","lang":"en","max_chars":8000}
